<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:13:15.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "## Deep Dive\n\nThese panels walk you through the next activity where you upload the flowchart from the previous level and code the logic. \n\nAs you click through, focus on **noticing patterns and ideas**, not memorizing syntax. You are not expected to understand or remember every line of code yet.\n\n\n## Checking Logic \nThe level starts with a basic shell that you will update with the scenario you created with your flowchart. \n\nIn the final result, you should be able to check the boxes and run the code and the correct result should appear based on the logic in the flow chart. \n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/21f29a5783e1821137e17bd00959396a-logic check.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-API-Calll-POkemon-panel-ca1b435a-713a-44b6-9ca1-5de1dddec908",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Upload the flowchart\nThis first step is to add the image file of the flowchart card you created.\n\nClick to the AI Tutor and add your file with some simple directions for the prompt.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e540422768416ab4d3ebf11ff078191d-logic check (1).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-c33a3e18-8347-4ffb-a912-9ad23d736caf",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Two Conditions\nAsk the AI to update the conditions to follow the flow chart. \n\nIn this example, order total over 50 should replace condition A and shipping coupon should replace condition B. \n\nYour flowchart could have different conditions. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d50a72bc9e6c0c6d3ab00ca4ae059bcd-logic check (2).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-f97c88e4-392c-41c5-84e6-f6a7270453f2",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Run the Code \nNow, the text for the check boxes are updated, but the code doesn’t work.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2ff2ef04fbf8592d7fd3887d0e40f545-logic check (3).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-12ccdac5-9a9c-468d-9683-9997fcbda518",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Update the element IDs\n\nThe AI should now guide you to update the element ID names in the JavaScript to match the HTML.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/52124c07397deb869965328322291aa2-logic check (4).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-7b210341-3c8a-4956-8577-a669e09b41a9",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Find the descriptive IDs\n\nBy opening the HTML file, we can find the new, descriptive ID names for the checkboxes. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/19f48c7d5d1400ec0c678ed5e2e6c4e2-logic check (5).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-f1d03732-7f48-4cae-99a8-07f7dd82cdec",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Update the JavaScript \n\nThe next step is to make the changes in JavaScript. The old id of `condA` needs to be changed to `orderTotalOver50`.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2dd4f50dd1489413feafbf10bafa2d93-logic check (6).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-8cc8fc10-86e9-44a8-ab4c-ac51f3e70252",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Update the JavaScript\n\nThe `condB` ID needs to be updated to `hasShippingCoupon`. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a102076e003a723c498edad138f3b5b7-logic check (7).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-d17bb951-3f30-446e-a14e-d5d92171b352",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Test the Code\nTest the logic to make sure it works by checking boxes and running the code multiple times with different situations. \n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/294eed28da14cb42c75f4b11a4dc1a0b-logic check (8).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-060be596-e36d-4aa9-a730-939453bdac7d",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Update the messages \n\nThe last step is to update the message in the code to match the flowchart. \n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/fbc7746799160b612963e07407ef07c5-logic check (9).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-4145a7af-50e6-4ee2-a530-2c82cf34113b",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Update the messages\n\nReplace the messages in the flowchart logic section with the messages that correspond with the outputs in your flowchart.  ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c5c7b00a239b9751be9cce0e2afb4805-logic check (10).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-1f9e0789-959b-47c5-aa67-1a9ff348ea4f",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Test the code\nTest the code one more time to make sure all the combinations match the correct message. \n\n## Now your turn! \nRemember, the AI might not give you the exact same results. Feel free to return to this tutorial any time.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6264d86f654cedc8aad67ec8bcabaa44-logic check (12).png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U5-logic-code-panel-66cc9fe6-ba38-4112-ba4d-04edc45fa544",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_2025-pilot"
  },
